From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
Subject: [PATCH] Write the null dereference before abort() in cubeb_crash

Carried from the vendored copy in UXP: perform the volatile null
write before abort() so crash reports attribute the fault to the
explicit dereference instead of the raise(). No functional change
for the oasis build; keeps the tree identical to UXP.
---
diff --git a/src/cubeb.c b/src/cubeb.c
--- a/src/cubeb.c
+++ b/src/cubeb.c
@@ -568,7 +568,7 @@
 void
 cubeb_crash()
 {
-  abort();
   *((volatile int *) NULL) = 0;
+  abort();
 }
 
